{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Amazon 為 Samsung 990 PRO SSD 帶來優惠，4TB 型號降價 36% 至 US$699.99，1TB 及 2TB 型號則分別售 US$259.99 與 US$389.99。這款 PCIe 4.0 NVMe SSD 主打高速讀寫與大容量選擇，適合遊戲、剪片及 PS5 擴充等用途。若正打算升級儲存空間，現在是不錯的入手時機。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"Samsung 990 PRO 速度與容量介紹\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"360\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/614i-Ohj-GBL.jpg\" width=\"640\"/></figure>\n<h2>Samsung 990 PRO SSD（1TB／2TB／4TB） 重點功能</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>PCIe 4.0 高速傳輸</strong>：採用 PCIe 4.0 x4、M.2 2280 介面，官方標示最高連續讀取 7,450 MB/s、寫入 6,900 MB/s，已接近 PCIe 4.0 上限，處理大型檔案更快。</li>\n<li><strong>隨機效能顯著提升</strong>：隨機效能比 980 PRO 提升超過 55%，每瓦效能最多提升 50%，長時間遊戲、剪片或數據分析都更流暢，同時兼顧能源效益。</li>\n<li><strong>多容量與硬件加密</strong>：提供 1TB 至 4TB 容量，桌面機、筆電及 PS5 加裝都合用，4TB／2TB 大容量適合存放遊戲與創作素材；內建 AES 256-bit 硬件加密，兼容 Samsung Magician 管理軟件。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHJF2VRN?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Samsung SSD 990 PRO 1TB, PCIe 4.0 M.2 2280, Up to 7,450 MB/s | NVMe Internal Solid State Hard Drive for High End Computing, Gaming, and Heavy Duty Workstations (MZ-V9P1T0B/AM)\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41LriB3kSfL._SL500_.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHJF2VRN?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Samsung SSD 990 PRO 1TB, PCIe 4.0 M.2 2280, Up to 7,450 MB/s | NVMe Internal Solid State Hard Drive for High End Computing, Gaming, and Heavy Duty Workstations (MZ-V9P1T0B/AM)</a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>$259.99</p>\n<p>$319.99</p>\n<p>-19%</p>\n</p>\n<p>In Stock</p>\n</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHJF2VRN?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">立即購買</a>\n</p>\n</p>\n</p>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHJJ9Y77?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Samsung SSD 990 PRO 2TB, PCIe 4.0 M.2 2280, Up to 7,450 MB/s | NVMe Internal Solid State Hard Drive for High End Computing, Gaming, and Heavy Duty Workstations, (MZ-V9P2T0B/AM)\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Jf2yGpAgL._SL500_.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHJJ9Y77?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Samsung SSD 990 PRO 2TB, PCIe 4.0 M.2 2280, Up to 7,450 MB/s | NVMe Internal Solid State Hard Drive for High End Computing, Gaming, and Heavy Duty Workstations, (MZ-V9P2T0B/AM)</a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>$389.99</p>\n<p>$639.99</p>\n<p>-39%</p>\n</p>\n<p>In Stock</p>\n</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHJJ9Y77?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">立即購買</a>\n</p>\n</p>\n</p>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CHGT1KFJ?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Samsung SSD 990 PRO 4TB, PCIe 4.0 M.2 2280, Up to 7,450 MB/s | NVMe Internal Solid State Hard Drive for High End Computing, Gaming, and Heavy Duty Workstations (MZ-V9P4T0B/AM)\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41QZdNEpzAL._SL500_.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CHGT1KFJ?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Samsung SSD 990 PRO 4TB, PCIe 4.0 M.2 2280, Up to 7,450 MB/s | NVMe Internal Solid State Hard Drive for High End Computing, Gaming, and Heavy Duty Workstations (MZ-V9P4T0B/AM)</a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>$699.99</p>\n<p>$1,099.99</p>\n<p>-36%</p>\n</p>\n<p>In Stock</p>\n</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CHGT1KFJ?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">立即購買</a>\n</p>\n</p>\n</p>\n<h2>PS5 宜選 Heat Sink 版</h2>\n<p>《GTA 6》單隻遊戲已經近 200GB，你的 PS5 空間不足？加 SSD 的話必須選擇 Heat Sink 版才行！</p>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHJDY57J?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Samsung 990 PRO w/Heatsink SSD 2TB, PCIe Gen4 M.2 2280, up to 7,450MB/s | NVMe Internal Solid State Hard Drive Best for PlayStation 5 (PS5 SSD) Console Expansion (MZ-V9P2T0CW)\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31iNrvsSA3L._SL500_.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHJDY57J?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Samsung 990 PRO w/Heatsink SSD 2TB, PCIe Gen4 M.2 2280, up to 7,450MB/s | NVMe Internal Solid State Hard Drive Best for PlayStation 5 (PS5 SSD) Console Expansion (MZ-V9P2T0CW)</a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>$518.70</p>\n<p>$669.99</p>\n<p>-23%</p>\n</p>\n<p>In Stock</p>\n</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHJDY57J?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">立即購買</a>\n</p>\n</p>\n</p>\n<h2>為什麼會顯示沒有貨？</h2>\n<p>如果大家的 Amazon 帳號設定了本地地址，這樣當顯示美國限定產品時是會顯示「沒有供應」，然而大家只要輸入一些<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/2019/05/06/buy-and-ship/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">集運公司的地址</a>，這樣就可以正常顯示價格及送貨。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"Amazon 美國送貨地址設定\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"868\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/amazon-us-address.jpg\" width=\"1630\"/></figure>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T23:44:31.837272+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1522,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T08:49:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T02:37:36.030922+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T23:37:46.731003+00:00","content_hash":